  "summary": "Backports two merged documentation pull requests to the 30.x maintenance branch ahead of a future point release. Specifically, it brings in PR #36377 to document BIP 461 in `bips.md`, and PR #36441 to correct upgrade instructions for installations using the wrapper executable, alongside 30.x release note updates.",
  "problem": "The 30.x branch lacks documentation updates from master: BIP 461 was omitted from `doc/bips.md`, and the \"How to Upgrade\" guidance in release notes told users to copy only `bitcoind` or `bitcoin-qt`, which leaves binaries in `libexec/` stale on installs using the `bitcoin` wrapper.",
